<title>PHILIPPINES: Hi Cement nine-mth net more than doubles.</title>
<headline>Hi Cement nine-mth net more than doubles.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to March 31</p>
<p>	    (in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net sales (billion)	    3.46 vs 2.10</p>
<p>    Net income		     276.51 vs 132.45</p>
<p>Note: Full name Hi Cement Corp. The figures are unaudited.</p>
